WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:04.940
A hotel reception. Adam wants to book a room.

2
00:00:05.790 --> 00:00:07.910
Dzień dobry, w czym mogę pomóc?

3
00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:12.160
Chciałbym zarezerwować pokój dwuosobowy na weekend.

4
00:00:12.510 --> 00:00:17.830
A polite wish: the conditional, in the form a man uses.

5
00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:19.880
Na dwie noce?

6
00:00:20.530 --> 00:00:23.650
Tak. Czy śniadanie jest wliczone w cenę?

7
00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:27.220
Tak, śniadanie jest od siódmej do dziesiątej.

8
00:00:28.970 --> 00:00:33.170
Chciałbym zarezerwować pokój na dwie noce.

9
00:00:33.970 --> 00:00:37.450
The conditional makes a wish polite.

10
00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:40.800
Men and women use slightly different endings.

11
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:47.240
Adam asks if breakfast is included. What does he say?

12
00:00:49.740 --> 00:00:52.860
Tak. Czy śniadanie jest wliczone w cenę?

13
00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:57.420
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

14
00:00:59.220 --> 00:01:02.340
Tak. Czy śniadanie jest wliczone w cenę?

15
00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:08.260
A woman would like a train ticket. What does she say?

16
00:01:10.760 --> 00:01:12.720
Chciałabym bilet do Gdańska.

17
00:01:13.520 --> 00:01:17.280
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

18
00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:21.040
Chciałabym bilet do Gdańska.

19
00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:26.680
Now practise with the exercises below the video.
